#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/security/polkit.xml:146
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"One polkit authentication agent for using polkit in the graphical "
"environment: <application>polkit-kde-agent</application> in <xref "
"role=\"runtime\" linkend=\"plasma5-build\"/> for KDE, the agent built in "
"<xref role=\"runtime\" linkend=\"gnome-shell\"/> for GNOME3, <xref "
"role=\"runtime\" linkend=\"polkit-gnome\"/> for XFCE, and <xref "
"role=\"runtime\" linkend=\"lxqt-policykit\"/> for LXQt"
msgstr ""
"Um agente de autenticação polkit para usar polkit no ambiente gráfico: "
"<application>polkit-kde-agent</application> em <xref role=\"runtime\" "
"linkend=\"plasma5-build\"/> para KDE, o agente construído em <xref "
"role=\"runtime\" linkend=\"gnome-shell\"/> para GNOME3, <xref "
"role=\"runtime\" linkend=\"polkit-gnome\"/> para XFCE e <xref "
"role=\"runtime\" linkend=\"lxqt-policykit\"/> para LXQt"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><note><para>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/security/polkit.xml:158
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"If <xref linkend=\"libxslt\"/> is installed, then <xref "
"linkend=\"DocBook\"/> and <xref linkend=\"docbook-xsl\"/> are required. If "
"you have installed <xref linkend=\"libxslt\"/>, but you do not want to "
"install any of the DocBook packages mentioned, you will need to use "
"<option>-Dman=false</option> in the instructions below."
msgstr ""
"Se <xref linkend=\"libxslt\"/> estiver instalado, então <xref "
"linkend=\"DocBook\"/> e <xref linkend=\"docbook-xsl\"/> serão exigidos. Se "
"você tiver instalado <xref linkend=\"libxslt\"/>, mas não deseja instalar "
"nenhum dos pacotes DocBook mencionados, [então] você precisará usar "
"<option>-Dman=false</option> nas instruções abaixo."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/security/polkit.xml:170
#, xml-text
msgid "Installation of Polkit"
msgstr "Instalação do Polkit"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/security/polkit.xml:173
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"There should be a dedicated user and group to take control of the "
"<command>polkitd</command> daemon after it is started. Issue the following "
"commands as the <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user:"
msgstr ""
"Deveria existir um(a) usuário(a) e um grupo dedicado(a) para assumir o "
"controle do processo de segundo plano <command>polkitd</command> depois que "
"ele for iniciado. Emita os seguintes comandos como o(a) usuário(a) "
"<systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem>:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/security/polkit.xml:179
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>groupadd -fg 27 polkitd &amp;&amp;\n"
"useradd -c \"PolicyKit Daemon Owner\" -d /etc/polkit-1 -u 27 \\\n"
"        -g polkitd -s /bin/false polkitd</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>groupadd -fg 27 polkitd &amp;&amp;\n"
"useradd -c \"Dono(a) do Processo de Segundo Plano do PolicyKit\" -d /etc/polkit-1 -u 27 \\\n"
"        -g polkitd -s /bin/false polkitd</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/security/polkit.xml:184
#, xml-text
msgid "First fix a build problem for sysV based systems:"
msgstr ""
"Primeiro, corrija um problema de construção para sistemas baseados em sysV:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/security/polkit.xml:187
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>sed -i '/systemd_sysusers_dir/s/^/#/' meson.build</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>sed -i '/systemd_sysusers_dir/s/^/#/' meson.build</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/security/polkit.xml:190
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Install <application>Polkit</application> by running the following commands:"
msgstr ""
"Instale o <application>Polkit</application> executando os seguintes "
"comandos:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/security/polkit.xml:194
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>mkdir build &amp;&amp;\n"
"cd    build &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"meson setup ..                            \\\n"
"      --prefix=/usr                       \\\n"
"      --buildtype=release                 \\\n"
"      -Dman=true                          \\\n"
"      -Dsession_tracking=libsystemd-login \\\n"
"      -Dtests=true                        &amp;&amp;\n"
"ninja</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>mkdir build &amp;&amp;\n"
"cd    build &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"meson setup ..                            \\\n"
"      --prefix=/usr                       \\\n"
"      --buildtype=release                 \\\n"
"      -Dman=true                          \\\n"
"      -Dsession_tracking=libsystemd-login \\\n"
"      -Dtests=true                        &amp;&amp;\n"
"ninja</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/security/polkit.xml:205
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>mkdir build &amp;&amp;\n"
"cd    build &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"meson setup ..                      \\\n"
"      --prefix=/usr                 \\\n"
"      --buildtype=release           \\\n"
"      -Dman=true                    \\\n"
"      -Dsession_tracking=libelogind \\\n"
"      -Dtests=true                  &amp;&amp;\n"
"ninja</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>mkdir build &amp;&amp;\n"
"cd    build &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"meson setup ..                      \\\n"
"      --prefix=/usr                 \\\n"
"      --buildtype=release           \\\n"
"      -Dman=true                    \\\n"
"      -Dsession_tracking=libelogind \\\n"
"      -Dtests=true                  &amp;&amp;\n"
"ninja</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/security/polkit.xml:217
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"To test the results, first ensure that the system "
"<application>D-Bus</application> daemon is running, and both <xref "
"linkend='dbus-python'/> and <xref linkend='python-dbusmock'/> are installed."
"  Then run <command>ninja test</command>."
msgstr ""
"Para testar os resultados, primeiro certifique-se de que o processo de "
"segundo plano <application>D-Bus</application> do sistema esteja executando "
"e que <xref linkend='dbus-python'/> e <xref linkend='python-dbusmock'/> "
"estejam instalados. Em seguida, execute <command>ninja test</command>."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/security/polkit.xml:225
#, xml-text
msgid "Now, as the <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user:"
msgstr ""
"Agora, como o(a) usuário(a) <systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem>:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/security/polkit.xml:228
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>ninja install</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>ninja install</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/security/polkit.xml:233
#, xml-text
msgid "Command Explanations"
msgstr "Explicações do Comando"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/security/polkit.xml:239
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>-Dtests=true</parameter>: This switch allows to run the test "
"suite of this package.  As <application>Polkit</application> is used for "
"authorizations, its integrity can affect system security.  So it's "
"recommended to run the test suite building this package."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>-Dtests=true</parameter>: Essa chave permite executar a suíte de "
"teste deste pacote. Como <application>Polkit</application> é usado para "
"autorizações, a integridade dele pode afetar a segurança do sistema. "
"Portanto, é recomendado executar a suíte de teste construindo este pacote."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/security/polkit.xml:246
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<option>-Djs_engine=mozjs</option>: This switch allows using the <xref "
"linkend=\"spidermonkey\"/> JavaScript engine instead of the <xref "
"linkend='duktape'/> JavaScript engine."
msgstr ""
"<option>-Djs_engine=mozjs</option>: Essa chave permite usar o mecanismo "
"JavaScript <xref linkend=\"spidermonkey\"/> em vez do mecanismo JavaScript "
"<xref linkend='duktape'/>."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/security/polkit.xml:264
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<option>-Dos_type=lfs</option>: Use this switch if you did not create the "
"<filename>/etc/lfs-release</filename> file or distribution auto detection "
"will fail and you will be unable to use <application>Polkit</application>."
msgstr ""
"<option>-Dos_type=lfs</option>: Use essa chave se você não criou o arquivo "
"<filename>/etc/lfs-release</filename> ou a detecção automática da "
"distribuição falhará e você estará inapto(a) a usar o "
"<application>Polkit</application>."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/security/polkit.xml:271
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<option>-Dauthfw=shadow</option>: This switch enables the package to use the"
" <application>Shadow</application> rather than the <application>Linux "
"PAM</application> Authentication framework. Use it if you have not installed"
" <application>Linux PAM</application>."
msgstr ""
"<option>-Dauthfw=shadow</option>: Essa chave habilita o pacote a usar o "
"<application>Shadow</application> em vez da estrutura de autenticação "
"<application>Linux PAM</application>. Use-a se você não tiver instalado "
"<application>Linux PAM</application>."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/security/polkit.xml:283
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<option>-Dintrospection=false</option>: Use this option if you are certain "
"that you do not need gobject-introspection files for polkit, or do not have "
"gobject-introspection installed."
msgstr ""
"<option>-Dintrospection=false</option>: Use essa opção se tiver certeza de "
"que não precisa dos arquivos gobject-introspection para o polkit ou não "
"tiver o gobject-introspection instalado."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/security/polkit.xml:289
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<option>-Dman=false</option>: Use this option to disable generating and "
"installing manual pages. This is useful if libxslt is not installed."
msgstr ""
"<option>-Dman=false</option>: Use essa opção para desabilitar a geração e a "
"instalação das páginas de manual. Isso é útil se libxslt não estiver "
"instalado."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/security/polkit.xml:294
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<option>-Dexamples=true</option>: Use this option to build the example "
"programs."
msgstr ""
"<option>-Dexamples=true</option>: Use essa opção para construir os "
"aplicativos de exemplo."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/security/polkit.xml:299
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<option>-Dgtk_doc=true</option>: Use this option to enable building and "
"installing the API documentation."
msgstr ""
"<option>-Dgtk_doc=true</option>: Use essa opção para habilitar a construção "
"e a instalação da documentação da API."

